{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}
{% block title %} Loan Buyback: Easily Reduce Your Monthly Payments {% endblock %}
{% block meta_description %}
      Combine all your loans to reduce your monthly payments. Quick simulation, free and no-obligation assessment.
{% endblock %}
{% block meta_keywords %}
 loan buyback
{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
    <main class="professional-loan">
    <section class="hero-section hero-rachat-credit text-white d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Credit Buyback</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Simplify your budget by consolidating your loans and reduce your monthly payments.</p>
        <a href="#details" class="btn btn-primary-custom btn-lg mt-4">Learn more</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="introduction" class="py-5 bg-light-blue">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-4">Understanding Credit Buyback</h2>
                <p class="lead text-secondary-dark">
                    Faced with multiple loan payments, a tight budget, or a project requiring new financing capacity, <strong>credit buyback</strong> offers a breath of fresh air. This financial solution consists of consolidating all your loans into one, with a single monthly payment, often lower, and an adapted repayment period. At <strong>{{NAME_SITE}}</strong>, we help you regain peaceful budget management and free up purchasing power for your projects.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="details" class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="200">
            <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-12 mx-auto">
                <h2 class="section-title text-primary-dark mb-4 text-center">Our Approach to Loan Consolidation</h2>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-md-6 order-md-2" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 video-container shadow-sm rounded">
                    <img src="{{asset('img/img26.jpg')}}" class="rounded shadow-sm img-fluid w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover" loading="lazy">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 order-md-1">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-3">What exactly is Loan Consolidation?</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    <strong>Loan consolidation</strong>, also known as debt consolidation, is a financial operation that allows you to group several loans (<strong>mortgage loans, consumer loans, car loans, revolving credit, various debts</strong>) into a single loan. The main objective is to reduce the amount of your monthly payments by extending the repayment period and/or by benefiting from a potentially lower interest rate. This solution simplifies the management of your budget with a single monthly payment, and can even free up additional capital for a new project.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 feature-row" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 video-container shadow-sm rounded">
                    <img src="{{asset('img/img27.png')}}" class="rounded shadow-sm img-fluid w-100 h-100 object-fit-cover" loading="lazy">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h3 class="feature-title text-accent-red mb-3">Why choose {{NAME_SITE}} for your Loan Consolidation?</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary-dark">
                    We are your expert for an effective debt consolidation solution:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **In-depth Analysis:** A personalized study of your situation for a tailor-made solution.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Monthly Payment Reduction:** Primary objective is to lighten your monthly financial burden.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Administrative Simplicity:** A single point of contact and a simplified process.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **Optimized Rates:** Access to negotiated market conditions for your new loan.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary-dark me-2"></i> **New Momentum:** Possibility to integrate a cash flow need for a new project.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mb-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
