                                <i class="fas fa-chart-pie fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Optimized Rate</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Benefit from a potentially more advantageous interest rate.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-light-blue text-primary-dark text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-lightbulb fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">New Projects</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Integrate additional cash for a new project.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0 bg-primary-dark text-white text-center p-3">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <i class="fas fa-heartbeat fa-2x mb-3 text-accent-red"></i>
                                <h5 class="card-title">Regained Serenity</h5>
                                <p class="card-text">Avoid over-indebtedness and breathe financially.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
